{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB《東張西望》近日播出一宗堪稱比劇集更離奇家庭糾紛，正室蕭小姐與介入婚姻第三者楊小姐原本勢成水火，後來竟結 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB《東張西望》近日播出一宗堪稱比劇集更離奇家庭糾紛，正室蕭小姐與介入婚姻第三者楊小姐原本勢成水火，後來竟結成閨密並涉及金錢利益。蕭小姐一度大方表示願意將丈夫李生拱手相讓，最終卻選擇與丈夫復合，更被指拖欠楊小姐5萬元不還而引發連串追債衝突。兩女由親密姊妹瞬間反目成仇，甚至在街頭當面對質互揭涉嫌違法驚人黑歷史。</p>\n<h2>楊小姐借《東張》大控訴</h2>\n<p>為了追討這筆5萬元欠款，楊小姐在《東張》主持李旻芳陪同下直接找蕭小姐當面對質，雙方隨即在街頭爆發激烈口角。蕭小姐堅稱對方威脅要去兒子學校及工作地點騷擾，而楊小姐亦坦承為追債確實講過及做過相關行為。戰火隨後蔓延至李生住所，楊小姐帶同攝製隊及主持李旻芳上門並要求男方出面交代，由李先生的兒子應門。東張主持向先表明來意後，李先生不停大叫關門，更伸手想關門。結果被楊小姐阻止，站在門口大叫他給回應：「點啊，回應吓，唔好喺度扮瞓覺啦！我係想得個交代啫。」</p>\n<h2>渣男終極現身 發惡反咬楊小姐騷擾致失業</h2>\n<p>李生強烈控訴楊小姐經常偷看其手機電話簿，甚至打電話騷擾他身邊親友，直指對方完全不懂得尊重別人。他更向鏡頭大吐苦水，指控楊小姐過度滋擾行為令他無辜失去工作，並反問對方究竟騙了自己多少錢。楊小姐則極力否認騙財，強調雙方交往期間一切金錢來往均屬你情我願，並反斥李生為人無賴兼歪曲事實。楊小姐與李先生互相指罵，李先生報警並指對方騙錢、扮慘及騷擾親友，令他失業，又否認一腳踏兩船：「咩你老公食大麻，出面有女人啊，我老公當我性奴啊，細細個已經畀老豆強姦啊，講到慘過啲劇啊！」雙方激烈爭執，警方到場了解後，暫未發現刑事成分。感情與金錢糾纏不清，楊小姐坦言後悔認識對方，只盼追回欠款，徹底一刀兩斷。</p>\n<h2>街頭爆罵戰 小三諷大婆與狗做愛</h2>\n<p>這對昔日好閨密之所以徹底決裂，除了牽涉5萬元債務，背後更隱藏著錯綜複雜感情瓜葛與驚人指控。蕭小姐表示：「我先生都有對我唔住嘅嘢，我有同佢講，我當時係真係放下戒心，真係想當佢係姊妹嘅，係同病相憐。」楊小姐指蕭小姐與老公復合如攬住隻狗：「你去同隻狗瞓啦。」蕭小姐反諷：「咁你之前都係同狗瞓，同狗做愛。」</p>\n<h2>大婆爆小三涉假結婚勾當</h2>\n<p>被問當初為何聲稱讓老公給楊小姐，蕭小姐表示對方傳一些色情短訊給她，聲稱：「佢話同佢去深圳，每次去，每次都搞，跟住一晚搞幾次。」當時她因為傷心，所以想成全對方。後來李生向妻子認錯保證改過，蕭小姐考慮到兒子患有自閉症及過度活躍症，決定為了維繫正常家庭而原諒丈夫。豈料雙方反目後，蕭小姐更拿出照片大爆楊小姐涉嫌參與報酬高達8萬元假結婚勾當，而楊小姐則辯稱自己是真結婚並只為賺取介紹費。</p>\n<h2>網民斥三角關係荒謬如鬧劇</h2>\n<p>節目播出後隨即在各大網上討論區掀起熱烈討論，大批觀眾對這段錯綜複雜三角關係感到難以置信。不少網民留言直斥三人行為極度荒謬，認為「劇情發展比劇集還要誇張」，並力撐正印：「大婆對！小三用自己老公嘅錢，大婆將D錢收番！個小三勾人地老公，有報應！」同時有部分留言將焦點放在蕭小姐身上，直指她「為息事寧人竟然連老公都可以讓出」，認為這段婚姻本身已經名存實亡。更有網民關注當中提及假結婚指控，強烈呼籲相關執法部門應介入徹查這宗可能牽涉8萬元利益違法行為。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932830404487636_13314004426ae353e11d8bb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 蕭小姐翻查手機記錄爆楊小姐涉假結婚。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932830404487636_13314004426ae353e11d8bb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>蕭小姐翻查手機記錄爆楊小姐涉假結婚。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328304948265740_14876110236ae353e9a4235.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 楊小姐稱因為表明沒有錢再借給蕭小姐，對方開始疏遠她。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328304948265740_14876110236ae353e9a4235.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>楊小姐稱因為表明沒有錢再借給蕭小姐，對方開始疏遠她。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932830577347036_21416191066ae353f2458e0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 蕭小姐指楊小姐曾到其子學校騷擾。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932830577347036_21416191066ae353f2458e0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>蕭小姐指楊小姐曾到其子學校騷擾。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328306949234109_15409672536ae353fddf894.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 李生反咬楊小姐訴說自己身世慘情搏同情。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328306949234109_15409672536ae353fddf894.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>李生反咬楊小姐訴說自己身世慘情搏同情。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328307777684502_18145127416ae3540613d75.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 大婆又與老公李生雙宿隻棲令楊小姐人財兩失。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328307777684502_18145127416ae3540613d75.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大婆又與老公李生雙宿隻棲令楊小姐人財兩失。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328309692648317_2897840546ae35419494c0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 曾與小三成好姊妹的蕭小姐受訪，稱與楊小姐不熟。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328309692648317_2897840546ae35419494c0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>曾與小三成好姊妹的蕭小姐受訪，稱與楊小姐不熟。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932831069523035_5608910636ae35423267d3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 東張主持李旻芳埋身追訪大婆蕭小姐。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932831069523035_5608910636ae35423267d3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>東張主持李旻芳埋身追訪大婆蕭小姐。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328311501765862_19773396856ae3542b591f4.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 楊小姐聲稱自己是真結婚。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328311501765862_19773396856ae3542b591f4.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>楊小姐聲稱自己是真結婚。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328312027135219_21020640156ae354306a4c4.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 蕭小姐爆楊小姐的假結婚對象。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328312027135219_21020640156ae354306a4c4.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>蕭小姐爆楊小姐的假結婚對象。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328312568831302_2915418516ae35435d4c30.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 小三楊小姐由東張主持李旻芳陪同與大婆蕭小姐對質。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328312568831302_2915418516ae35435d4c30.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>小三楊小姐由東張主持李旻芳陪同與大婆蕭小姐對質。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328313389816615_13948743736ae3543e211d5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 李旻芳追問楊小姐為何中途與第二個男人結婚。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328313389816615_13948743736ae3543e211d5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>李旻芳追問楊小姐為何中途與第二個男人結婚。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328314276874292_2929768416ae3544733b11.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 楊小姐與李旻芳到李生家中追債。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328314276874292_2929768416ae3544733b11.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>楊小姐與李旻芳到李生家中追債。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328315293662845_7523678656ae354514f9fa.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB 東張西望 楊小姐要求李生出面回應。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328315293662845_7523678656ae354514f9fa.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>楊小姐要求李生出面回應。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TVB</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%8b%e9%9b%86/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">下集</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a7%e5%a9%86%e7%84%a1%e9%96%93%e9%81%93/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大婆無間道</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張西望</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3532344\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 29 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:53.306280+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2070,"images":13,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:14:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:36.608129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:41.920147+00:00","content_hash":"34fc09ac533b6cfb7b8f60b1ee1e49594f4cce098e673d533192298207be827b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}